{"ImageContent":{"Description":"今天，我们一起欣赏笼罩在黑森林上空的朦胧景色。黑森林绵延约160公里，横跨德国西南部，汇集了葱郁的山丘、幽深的山谷、湖泊和迷人的小镇。最高峰费尔德贝格山海拔1,493米；多瑙河和内卡河也发源于黑森林。这里同样不乏历史与传统。林业长期以来在当地占据重要地位，而延续数百年的钟表制造传统，更让别具特色的布谷鸟钟名扬德国以外。","Image":{"Url":"/th?id=OHR.SchwarzwaldAutumn_ZH-CN6323627599_1920x1080.webp","Wallpaper":"/th?id=OHR.SchwarzwaldAutumn_ZH-CN6323627599_1920x1200.jpg&rf=LaDigue_1920x1200.jpg","Downloadable":true},"Headline":"林间迷雾","Title":"黑森林，巴登-符腾堡州，德国","Copyright":"© Britus/Getty Images","SocialGood":null,"MapLink":{"Url":"","Link":""},"QuickFact":{"MainText":"黑森林传统民俗头饰“绒球帽”上有14个羊毛绒球；未婚女性传统上佩戴红色绒球帽。","LinkUrl":"","LinkText":""},"TriviaUrl":"/search?q=Bing+homepage+quiz&filters=WQOskey:\"HPQuiz_20261101_SchwarzwaldAutumn\"&FORM=HPQUIZ","BackstageUrl":"/search?q=%e5%be%b7%e5%9b%bd%e9%bb%91%e6%a3%ae%e6%9e%97&form=hpcapt&filters=HpDate:\"20261031_1600\"+mgzv3configlist:\"BingQA_Encyclopedia_Layout\"","TriviaId":"HPQuiz_20261101_SchwarzwaldAutumn"},"Ssd":"20261101","Name":"SchwarzwaldAutumn","Market":"ZH-CN","Hash":"6323627599","FullDateString":"2026 11月 1","enddate":"20261101"},
{"ImageContent":{"Description":"11月也许让我们离节日季又近了一步，但北极熊有别的打算。它们聚集在加拿大马尼托巴省的哈得孙湾沿岸，等待海冰形成，以便重返冰面捕猎海豹。每年上演的这一幕催生了在11月第一周举行的北极熊周，以庆祝北极地区体型最大的陆生捕食者。北极熊是游泳健将、捕猎高手，也极其适应地球上最严酷的环境之一。然而，海冰不断缩减，意味着许多北极熊不得不在陆地上待更久，觅食更加困难，与人类相遇的风险也随之上升。","Image":{"Url":"/th?id=OHR.HudsonBear_ZH-CN6630706907_1920x1080.webp","Wallpaper":"/th?id=OHR.HudsonBear_ZH-CN6630706907_1920x1200.jpg&rf=LaDigue_1920x1200.jpg","Downloadable":true},"Headline":"写在冰上的未来","Title":"北极熊和幼崽，哈得孙湾畔，马尼托巴省，加拿大","Copyright":"© Danita Delimont/Adobe Stock","SocialGood":null,"MapLink":{"Url":"","Link":""},"QuickFact":{"MainText":"为了寻找食物和合适的海冰，北极熊在一个季节里可能跋涉超过620英里。","LinkUrl":"","LinkText":""},"TriviaUrl":"/search?q=Bing+homepage+quiz&filters=WQOskey:\"HPQuiz_20261102_HudsonBear\"&FORM=HPQUIZ","BackstageUrl":"/search?q=%e5%8c%97%e6%9e%81%e7%86%8a%e5%91%a8&form=hpcapt&filters=HpDate:\"20261101_1600\"+mgzv3configlist:\"BingQA_Encyclopedia_Layout\"","TriviaId":"HPQuiz_20261102_HudsonBear"},"Ssd":"20261102","Name":"HudsonBear","Market":"ZH-CN","Hash":"6630706907","FullDateString":"2026 11月 2","enddate":"20261102"},
{"ImageContent":{"Description":"布莱埃斯湖坐落在意大利北部南蒂罗尔的多洛米蒂山脉，海拔近1500米。湖泊四周森林环绕，法内斯-塞内斯-布莱埃斯湖自然公园的壮丽群峰耸立其间，以动人的碧绿和湛蓝湖水闻名。一条3.5公里长的步道环绕湖岸，游客也可以乘坐传统木质划艇，从另一种视角欣赏风光。这里还是多条山间徒步路线的起点，包括多洛米蒂山脉著名的多洛米蒂高山步道1号。","Image":{"Url":"/th?id=OHR.AlpineBraies_ZH-CN7307997866_1920x1080.webp","Wallpaper":"/th?id=OHR.AlpineBraies_ZH-CN7307997866_1920x1200.jpg&rf=LaDigue_1920x1200.jpg","Downloadable":true},"Headline":"群峰间的宁静","Title":"布莱埃斯湖，法内斯-塞内斯-布莱埃斯湖自然公园，多洛米蒂山脉，意大利","Copyright":"© leonid_tit/Getty Images","SocialGood":null,"MapLink":{"Url":"","Link":""},"QuickFact":{"MainText":"布莱埃斯湖最深处达36米，平均水深约17米。","LinkUrl":"","LinkText":""},"TriviaUrl":"/search?q=Bing+homepage+quiz&filters=WQOskey:\"HPQuiz_20261103_AlpineBraies\"&FORM=HPQUIZ","BackstageUrl":"/search?q=%e5%a4%9a%e6%b4%9b%e7%b1%b3%e8%92%82%e5%b1%b1%e8%84%89&form=hpcapt&filters=HpDate:\"20261102_1600\"+mgzv3configlist:\"BingQA_Encyclopedia_Layout\"","TriviaId":"HPQuiz_20261103_AlpineBraies"},"Ssd":"20261103","Name":"AlpineBraies","Market":"ZH-CN","Hash":"7307997866","FullDateString":"2026 11月 3","enddate":"20261103"},
{"ImageContent":{"Description":"在安徽省宣城，人们划船穿过色彩斑斓的落羽杉林。秋天将这片被水淹没的林地变成由琥珀色、铜色和深铁锈色交织而成的锦绣景致。落羽杉的学名是“Taxodium distichum”，它在针叶树中颇为特别：每年秋季，柔软如羽毛的针叶会先变成红褐色，然后脱落。在北美洲，落羽杉因能生长在沼泽、河漫滩等湿地环境而闻名，常长出称为“膝状根”的瘤状根部突起，露出周围的泥土和水面。","Image":{"Url":"/th?id=OHR.AutumnChina_ZH-CN7665959692_1920x1080.webp","Wallpaper":"/th?id=OHR.AutumnChina_ZH-CN7665959692_1920x1200.jpg&rf=LaDigue_1920x1200.jpg","Downloadable":true},"Headline":"泛舟如画秋林","Title":"五彩落羽杉间划船的人们，宣城，安徽省，中国","Copyright":"© Jackal Pan/Getty Images","SocialGood":null,"MapLink":{"Url":"","Link":""},"QuickFact":{"MainText":"落羽杉木材耐腐朽，历史上曾被用于制作木桶、铁路枕木和屋顶木瓦。","LinkUrl":"","LinkText":""},"TriviaUrl":"/search?q=Bing+homepage+quiz&filters=WQOskey:\"HPQuiz_20261104_AutumnChina\"&FORM=HPQUIZ","BackstageUrl":"/search?q=%e8%90%bd%e7%be%bd%e6%9d%89&form=hpcapt&filters=HpDate:\"20261103_1600\"+mgzv3configlist:\"BingQA_Encyclopedia_Layout\"","TriviaId":"HPQuiz_20261104_AutumnChina"},"Ssd":"20261104","Name":"AutumnChina","Market":"ZH-CN","Hash":"7665959692","FullDateString":"2026 11月 4","enddate":"20261104"},
{"ImageContent":{"Description":"一座简朴的木制翻越梯，将人们引向英格兰最负盛名的风景区之一。被列为联合国教科文组织世界遗产的湖区，湖泊波光粼粼，山丘崎岖起伏，古老的石墙纵横其间；自然力量与世代相传的农耕传统共同塑造了这片景观。","Image":{"Url":"/th?id=OHR.StileCrossing_ZH-CN9811465935_1920x1080.webp","Wallpaper":"/th?id=OHR.StileCrossing_ZH-CN9811465935_1920x1200.jpg&rf=LaDigue_1920x1200.jpg","Downloadable":true},"Headline":"向山巅再迈一步","Title":"石墙边的木制翻越梯，黑岩，湖区，英格兰","Copyright":"© Alex Treadway/Getty Images","SocialGood":null,"MapLink":{"Url":"","Link":""},"QuickFact":{"MainText":"英格兰湖区于2017年被列入联合国教科文组织世界遗产名录，其独特的文化景观由此获得认可。","LinkUrl":"","LinkText":""},"TriviaUrl":"/search?q=Bing+homepage+quiz&filters=WQOskey:\"HPQuiz_20261105_StileCrossing\"&FORM=HPQUIZ","BackstageUrl":"/search?q=%e8%8b%b1%e6%a0%bc%e5%85%b0%e6%b9%96%e5%8c%ba&form=hpcapt&filters=HpDate:\"20261104_1600\"+mgzv3configlist:\"BingQA_Encyclopedia_Layout\"","TriviaId":"HPQuiz_20261105_StileCrossing"},"Ssd":"20261105","Name":"StileCrossing","Market":"ZH-CN","Hash":"9811465935","FullDateString":"2026 11月 5","enddate":"20261105"},
{"ImageContent":{"Description":"火山、雨林和竹林？毛伊岛上的哈莱亚卡拉国家公园三者兼有。公园的范围从毛伊岛上海拔10023英尺的山顶一直延伸到海岸，保护着随海拔、降雨量和气温变化而呈现迥异面貌的景观。它于1916年作为夏威夷国家公园的一部分设立，1961年成为独立的国家公园。哈莱阿卡拉意为“太阳之家”，这一名称呼应了夏威夷口述传说“moʻolelo”中毛伊捉住太阳、延长白昼的故事。","Image":{"Url":"/th?id=OHR.PipiwaiTrail_ZH-CN1811194311_1920x1080.webp","Wallpaper":"/th?id=OHR.PipiwaiTrail_ZH-CN1811194311_1920x1200.jpg&rf=LaDigue_1920x1200.jpg","Downloadable":true},"Headline":"穿越毛伊岛的绿色隧道","Title":"竹林，皮皮维小径，哈莱亚卡拉国家公园，毛伊岛，夏威夷州，美国","Copyright":"© MNStudio/Getty Images","SocialGood":null,"MapLink":{"Url":"","Link":""},"QuickFact":{"MainText":"前往哈莱阿卡拉山顶观赏日出的游客须提前预约；名额最多提前60天开放。","LinkUrl":"","LinkText":""},"TriviaUrl":"/search?q=Bing+homepage+quiz&filters=WQOskey:\"HPQuiz_20261106_PipiwaiTrail\"&FORM=HPQUIZ","BackstageUrl":"/search?q=%e5%93%88%e8%8e%b1%e4%ba%9a%e5%8d%a1%e6%8b%89%e5%9b%bd%e5%ae%b6%e5%85%ac%e5%9b%ad&form=hpcapt&filters=HpDate:\"20261105_1600\"+mgzv3configlist:\"BingQA_Encyclopedia_Layout\"","TriviaId":"HPQuiz_20261106_PipiwaiTrail"},"Ssd":"20261106","Name":"PipiwaiTrail","Market":"ZH-CN","Hash":"1811194311","FullDateString":"2026 11月 6","enddate":"20261106"},
{"ImageContent":{"Description":"再艰难的环境，也挡不住野牛吃草的脚步。美国全国野牛日赞颂这种北美哺乳动物：它体重可达2000磅(约907千克)，奔跑时速却能达到35英里(约56千米)。这个节日定在每年11月的第一个星期六，旨在向2016年成为美国国家哺乳动物的野牛致敬。","Image":{"Url":"/th?id=OHR.DakotaBison_ZH-CN2302503868_1920x1080.webp","Wallpaper":"/th?id=OHR.DakotaBison_ZH-CN2302503868_1920x1200.jpg&rf=LaDigue_1920x1200.jpg","Downloadable":true},"Headline":"归来的草原巨兽","Title":"草原上的一头野牛，西奥多·罗斯福国家公园，北达科他州，美国","Copyright":"© Tandem Stock/Adobe Stock","SocialGood":null,"MapLink":{"Url":"","Link":""},"QuickFact":{"MainText":"野牛在泥土中打滚形成的浅坑可能积水，为草原植物和动物提供栖息地。","LinkUrl":"","LinkText":""},"TriviaUrl":"/search?q=Bing+homepage+quiz&filters=WQOskey:\"HPQuiz_20261107_DakotaBison\"&FORM=HPQUIZ","BackstageUrl":"/search?q=%e7%be%8e%e6%b4%b2%e9%87%8e%e7%89%9b&form=hpcapt&filters=HpDate:\"20261106_1600\"+mgzv3configlist:\"BingQA_Encyclopedia_Layout\"","TriviaId":"HPQuiz_20261107_DakotaBison"},"Ssd":"20261107","Name":"DakotaBison","Market":"ZH-CN","Hash":"2302503868","FullDateString":"2026 11月 7","enddate":"20261107"},
{"ImageContent":{"Description":"一年中最黑暗的夜晚遇上最明亮的庆典，会是什么景象？答案就是排灯节。世界各地数百万人庆祝这个灯节，点亮油灯和灯笼，绘制兰戈利彩绘，祈祷、品尝甜点，并与家人团聚。","Image":{"Url":"/th?id=OHR.DiwaliLamps_ZH-CN2462894749_1920x1080.webp","Wallpaper":"/th?id=OHR.DiwaliLamps_ZH-CN2462894749_1920x1200.jpg&rf=LaDigue_1920x1200.jpg","Downloadable":true},"Headline":"光芒四射的节日","Title":"排灯节灯笼，孟买，马哈拉施特拉邦，印度","Copyright":"© Dinodia Photo/Getty Images","SocialGood":null,"MapLink":{"Url":"","Link":""},"QuickFact":{"MainText":"排灯节持续五天，但由于它遵循印度教阴历，每年在公历上的日期都会变化。","LinkUrl":"","LinkText":""},"TriviaUrl":"/search?q=Bing+homepage+quiz&filters=WQOskey:\"HPQuiz_20261108_DiwaliLamps\"&FORM=HPQUIZ","BackstageUrl":"/search?q=%e6%8e%92%e7%81%af%e8%8a%82&form=hpcapt&filters=HpDate:\"20261107_1600\"+mgzv3configlist:\"BingQA_Encyclopedia_Layout\"","TriviaId":"HPQuiz_20261108_DiwaliLamps"},"Ssd":"20261108","Name":"DiwaliLamps","Market":"ZH-CN","Hash":"2462894749","FullDateString":"2026 11月 8","enddate":"20261108"},
{"ImageContent":{"Description":"在西班牙安达卢西亚地区首府塞维利亚，跨过瓜达尔基维尔河，城市的节奏似乎便悄然改变。河对岸是色彩缤纷的特里亚纳街区，陶艺、弗拉门戈和当地传统融入日常生活。自19世纪以来，伊莎贝尔二世桥——又称特里亚纳桥——一直连接着这里与塞维利亚的历史中心。","Image":{"Url":"/th?id=OHR.TrianaSpain_ZH-CN6329291776_1920x1080.webp","Wallpaper":"/th?id=OHR.TrianaSpain_ZH-CN6329291776_1920x1200.jpg&rf=LaDigue_1920x1200.jpg","Downloadable":true},"Headline":"艺术与韵律交汇之地","Title":"特里亚纳历史街区，塞维利亚，西班牙","Copyright":"© Andrzej Rostek/Getty Images","SocialGood":null,"MapLink":{"Url":"","Link":""},"QuickFact":{"MainText":"特里亚纳市场下方保留着圣豪尔赫城堡的遗址；这座城堡曾是宗教裁判所的总部，如今设有历史展览。","LinkUrl":"","LinkText":""},"TriviaUrl":"/search?q=Bing+homepage+quiz&filters=WQOskey:\"HPQuiz_20261109_TrianaSpain\"&FORM=HPQUIZ","BackstageUrl":"/search?q=%e8%a5%bf%e7%8f%ad%e7%89%99%e5%a1%9e%e7%bb%b4%e5%88%a9%e4%ba%9a&form=hpcapt&filters=HpDate:\"20261108_1600\"+mgzv3configlist:\"BingQA_Encyclopedia_Layout\"","TriviaId":"HPQuiz_20261109_TrianaSpain"},"Ssd":"20261109","Name":"TrianaSpain","Market":"ZH-CN","Hash":"6329291776","FullDateString":"2026 11月 9","enddate":"20261109"}
